Z||000004||Fiero_Freak||03-09-2001||06:26 PM||||I accually have just an 8" MTX but it's in a sorta round box with one corner being square to keep it from rolling.  It gets really boomy with it out...but tuck it in to where the speaker faces the center console wall...  Takes up even less space and kicks ass.  I just can't believe how good it sounds.  And the dash makes the sound completely omnidirectional.  I'll have to get a pic.||||reg||1
